<title>FRANCE: Bouygues Offshore 96 turnover 3.8 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bouygues Offshore 96 turnover 3.8 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover			  3.8 vs   3.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Bouygues Offshore, a unit of Bouygues, gave its turnover in a statement. It said it would it would announce full results in the third week of March.</p>
